<section class="summary">
  <h2>Lead Engineer — Web Platform &amp; AI-Augmented Development</h2>
  <p>
    Engineering lead with 15+ years of deep, hands-on web-platform expertise — HTML, CSS,
    JavaScript/TypeScript, web components, browser APIs, performance, and the architecture
    and design systems that hold large front ends together. As Development Lead at Spectra
    Media Collective I own the product's re-architecture onto React and Next.js, its AWS
    infrastructure, and AI-assisted interfaces over a large data catalogue.
  </p>
  <p>
    I practice AI-augmented development as an engineering discipline, on Claude Code: I
    drove my team's full adoption — building the agent-facing knowledge system the team
    codes against, authoring reusable agent skills and workflow tooling, and mentoring
    developers into directing agents effectively themselves. Deep platform knowledge is
    what turns AI coding from a shortcut into real leverage.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="skills">
  <h2>Skills</h2>
  <ul class="skills-list">
