    <li>Cloud &amp; delivery: AWS (Lambda, S3, EC2, Elastic Beanstalk, Amplify, Cognito), PostgreSQL, microservices, build &amp; deployment automation</li>
    <li>Testing &amp; process: TDD, Jest, Playwright, Puppeteer, automation; code review, mentorship, Agile/Scrum, DX</li>
    <li>Polyglot range: C#, SQL, shell scripting, functional programming — comfortable picking up new languages and stacks quickly</li>
  </ul>
</section>

